# 📜 RULE — Shared Infrastructure Contract

> **Authority**: GOPIA://olym.constitution.v1 + caw:/minispace/.know/canon/CONTRACT.ail
> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/rules/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/rules/shared-infra-contract.ail`

---

## R-SI-1 — 3 shared infra directories

Tại `caw:/minispace/`, PHẢI có:

```text
caw:/minispace/
├── .cargo/config.toml          # global cargo config (CSA-sealed)
├── .shared-target/             # shared cargo target-dir
├── .shared-vendor/             # shared crates vendor
└── .shared-registry/           # shared registry cache
    ├── github/
    ├── crates-io/
    ├── local/
    └── company/
```

## R-SI-2 — Config chuẩn

```toml
# caw:/minispace/.cargo/config.toml

[source.crates-io]
replace-with = "minispace-shared"

[source.minispace-shared]
directory = "caw:/minispace/.shared-vendor"

[registries.minispace-crates-io]
index = "sparse+https://index.crates.io/"

[registries.minispace-github]
index = "https://github.com/cosda-dev/hace-index"

[build]
target-dir = "caw:/minispace/.shared-target"
```

## R-SI-3 — Không duplicate per-workspace

| Pattern | Why |
|---|---|
| `ws-*/vendor/` | ❌ Dùng `.shared-vendor/` |
| `ws-*/target/` | ❌ Dùng `.shared-target/` |
| `ws-*/Cargo.lock` riêng biệt | ⚠️ cho phép, nhưng phải mirror `.shared-registry/` |

## R-SI-4 — Source of Truth Hierarchy

```yaml
resolution_order:
  - 1: "ha:/engine/*            # read-only"
  - 2: "gh:cosda-dev/*          # mirror"
  - 3: "gh:hugaalfatech/ros-go-olym  # Olym mirror"
  - 4: "crates.io               # upstream fallback"
  - 5: "caw:/minispace/.shared-vendor/  # local fast cache"
```

## R-SI-5 — Vendor Refresh

```powershell
# Refresh shared vendor từ crates.io
cargo vendor caw:/minispace/.shared-vendor

# Verify checksum
Get-FileHash caw:/minispace/.shared-vendor/serde-*/Cargo.toml
```

## R-SI-6 — Per-workspace override (rare)

Một `ws-*` chỉ được override registry khi cần version cụ thể không có
trong shared:

```toml
# ws-special/Cargo.toml
[patch.crates-io]
specific-crate = { path = "../local-patch" }
```

Override chỉ có hiệu lực trong scope `ws-special` — KHÔNG ảnh hưởng
`.shared-vendor/`.

